{"id":"tradicio_n","lemma":"tradición","pos":"noun","rank":2254,"glosses":["tradition","lore"],"ipa":"/tɾadiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tradiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tradici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Debemos mantener las tradiciones familiares.","en":"We must keep up the family traditions.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to keep"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"familial, family","l":"familiar"}]},{"text":"Esa tradición nació en China.","en":"The custom originated in China.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735454","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"to be born","l":"nacer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"china"}]},{"text":"Las buenas tradiciones deberían ser preservadas.","en":"Good traditions should be preserved.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"hello"},null,{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Es una tradición estadounidense pedir un deseo por tu cumpleaños.","en":"It's an American tradition to make a wish on your birthday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691825","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"American"},{"g":"to ask for something"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"desire, wish"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"birthday"}]},{"text":"Él dio la espalda a las viejas tradiciones.","en":"He turned his back on the old traditions.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"back"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"old person","l":"viejo"},null]}]}